  "text": "Originally incorporated as NNT Developers Private Limited on April 17, 2017 and subsequently converted into a public limited company, we are an infrastructure construction and EPC Company engaged in the execution, development, renovation, modernization and maintenance of civil engineering and infrastructure projects for government departments, public sector undertakings and institutional clients. We are engaged in diverse infrastructure verticals, including road and railway infrastructure, irrigation, flood protection and river management, water supply, commercial, institutional, industrial and public infrastructure, agricultural market infrastructure, tourism and recreational infrastructure",
